110
00:06:31,782 --> 00:06:33,653
No creo.

111
00:06:33,654 --> 00:06:35,263
Solo saca tu pie.

112
00:06:35,264 --> 00:06:36,918
Así.

113
00:06:38,441 --> 00:06:40,921
Ahora no, Buddy.

114
00:06:42,445 --> 00:06:44,141
Lo siento, Josh.

115
00:06:44,142 --> 00:06:46,796
Esos zapatos mágicos para bailar
