Nunca hice un trato.

122
00:07:19,569 --> 00:07:22,398
¡Solo no quiero bailar!

123
00:07:27,098 --> 00:07:28,882
Saca tu pierna, Josh,

124
00:07:28,883 --> 00:07:30,492
