316
00:16:59,975 --> 00:17:01,889
¡Chicos! ¡Chicos! ¡Chicos!

317
00:17:01,890 --> 00:17:03,630
♪ Un poco de sacudir
y fregar ♪

318
00:17:03,631 --> 00:17:04,457
Hannah.

319
00:17:04,458 --> 00:17:05,980
- ¡Oliver!
- ¡Oliver!

320
00:17:05,981 --> 00:17:07,547
